      hu: "A Hamboda-fennsík a Comore-szigetek egyik legfontosabb mezőgazdasági régiója, ahol a hűvösebb klíma lehetővé teszi a burgonya és a káposzta termesztését. A fennsíkon található egy kis botanikus kert, ahol gyógynövényeket termesztenek. A tájat vulkáni kráterek tarkítják, amelyek némelyike tavat rejt. A fennsík népszerű a kerékpáros túrázók körében. A helyi közösség fenntart egy hagyományos élelmiszer-feldolgozó üzemet, ahol sajtot és lekvárt készítenek. A fennsík tiszta levegője és csendje kiváló lehetőséget nyújt a kikapcsolódásra.",
      ro: "Podisul Hamboda este o regiune de altitudine medie, cu sol vulcanic fertil. Aici se cultivă cartofi, ceapă și morcovi, care aprovizionează piețele din Moroni. Pe podiș se află păduri de conifere introduse, care oferă lemn de construcție. Fauna include vulpea zburătoare de Comore (Pteropus livingstonii) și șopârle. Podișul este un loc important pentru cercetarea agroecologică. Vizitatorii pot face drumeții pe trasee marcate și pot observa agricultura tradițională.",
      en: "The Hamboda Plateau has historical importance as a refuge for the local population during tribal wars in the 18th century. The plateau's natural defenses made it a safe haven. Later, it became a site for coffee plantations established by French settlers. The plateau is also known for its distinctive megalithic structures, whose purpose remains unknown. In the 1970s, the plateau was part of a land reform program that distributed land to small farmers. Today, it is a stronghold of traditional farming practices, with many families growing organic vegetables. The plateau's cool climate also attracts tourists seeking respite from the coastal heat.",
